# English primary language

- User-facing strings, README, CHANGELOG, commit messages, and release notes are **English**.
- Put new copy in `lib/core/l10n/app_strings.dart` (`AppStrings`), not scattered literals, so ARB / flutter_localizations can replace the class later.
- Do not add Italian (or other) UI copy until a real i18n pass is planned.
